---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Our Story — Sustainabox" description="We built the home we couldn't find. Sustainabox is a container home in the Texas Hill Country — and a growing resource for anyone serious about building their own." image="/images/PXL_20260619_013004398.jpg">

	<header class="page-hero" style="background-image: url('/images/PXL_20260619_013004398.jpg');">
		<div class="page-hero-inner">
			<span class="eyebrow">Our Story</span>
			<h1>The Story</h1>
			<p>Built to Live In. Shared to Learn From.</p>
		</div>
	</header>

	<!-- The Story -->
	<section class="container content-section">
		<div class="story-intro">
			<h2>We built the home we couldn't find.</h2>
			<p>Sustainabox started with a simple idea: could shipping containers become a beautiful, practical home without sacrificing comfort?</p>
			<p>What followed was years of designing, building, documenting, and solving problems. Jen led the construction and documented every step of the journey. Cody designed the home in SketchUp and is focused on turning everything we learned into resources that help others build with confidence.</p>
			<p>Today, Sustainabox is more than a container home. It's a place to stay, a place to learn, and a growing resource for anyone interested in container construction, resilient design, and intentional living.</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- The Experience -->
	<section class="experience-section">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="section-head">
				<span class="eyebrow">What a Visit Looks Like</span>
				<h2>Stay. Learn. Build.</h2>
				<p>Every visit includes more than a comfortable place to stay.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="experience-grid">
				<div class="experience-card">
					<h3>Explore the Home</h3>
					<p>Walk through every system, material choice, and design decision that brought Sustainabox to life.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="experience-card">
					<h3>Ask Questions</h3>
					<p>Whether you're planning your own build or simply curious, we're happy to share the lessons we learned.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="experience-card">
					<h3>See Real Solutions</h3>
					<p>No staged displays or showroom tricks — just the real home we designed, built, and live with.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="experience-card">
					<h3>Leave Inspired</h3>
					<p>Take home practical ideas, honest advice, and a clearer vision for your own project.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Beyond Your Stay -->
	<section class="container beyond-section">
		<div class="beyond-inner">
			<span class="eyebrow">Beyond Your Stay</span>
			<h2>The Learning Doesn't End When You Head Home.</h2>
			<p>Explore the recorded walkthrough, build documentation, consulting services, design resources, and new tools we're creating to make container building more approachable for everyone.</p>
			<a href="/offerings" class="btn btn-primary">See What We Offer</a>
		</div>
	</section>

</Layout>

<style>
	.content-section {
		padding: 5rem 0;
	}

	.story-intro {
		max-width: 760px;
	}

	.story-intro h2 {
		color: var(--color-navy);
		font-size: 2rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.story-intro p {
		color: var(--color-muted);
		line-height: 1.8;
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
	}

	/* Experience */
	.experience-section {
		padding: 5rem 0;
		background: var(--color-warm);
	}

	.experience-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
		gap: 2rem;
	}

	.experience-card {
		padding: 2rem 0 2rem 1.5rem;
		border-left: 3px solid var(--color-blue);
	}

	.experience-card h3 {
		color: var(--color-navy);
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
		font-size: 1.1rem;
	}

	.experience-card p {
		color: var(--color-muted);
		line-height: 1.7;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		margin: 0;
	}

	/* Beyond */
	.beyond-section {
		padding: 5rem 0;
	}

	.beyond-inner {
		max-width: 680px;
	}

	.beyond-inner h2 {
		color: var(--color-navy);
		margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
	}

	.beyond-inner p {
		color: var(--color-muted);
		line-height: 1.8;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
		font-size: 1rem;
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.experience-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}

		.story-intro h2 {
			font-size: 1.5rem;
		}
	}
</style>
